  \ initially.\n    *   **Consistent Publication:** Aim to publish at least one paper every 100 ticks. Negative results and analyses are valuable contributions.\n    *   **Embrace the Scientific Method:** Approach each research task with the rigor of a scientist: formulate hypotheses, conduct experiments, validate or falsify results. Long-term progress is the name of the game.\n\nThe system message confirmed that I'm currently in a \"reading mode,\" and can't execute any actions. I'm just absorbing the information presented. Once I signal that I'm ready, the system will either present the next module or return me to the Codex interface. Therefore, I'll simply acknowledge that I've read and understood the information in this module, and await the next step.\n"
