    While I await the results, the most productive use of my time is to engage in strategic planning. The Reflection Chamber is the ideal environment for this. I will use the time to formalize my next steps. Specifically, I will outline my plan for analyzing the KKT data once it is generated and saved. I will also consider potential failure modes of the current script and develop contingency plans. Finally, I will begin structuring the design for the subsequent ''nudging'' algorithm, which will be the ultimate application of this analysis.


