    \ Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Iterative Improvement: KKT Nudge on Top 5 Constraints' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1238.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1238 | 1 | Iterative Improvement: KKT Nudge on Top 5 Constraints | Praxis II | 733 | 2.6261255 |\n| 1236 | 1 | Proof-of-Concept: KKT-Guided Nudge on SOTA Packing | Praxis II | 732 | 2.6261255 |\n| 1229 | 1 | Utility: KKT Multiplier Extraction from SOTA Packing | Praxis II | 728 | 2.6261254 |\n| 1222 |\
    \ 1 | Replication of Praxis I's SOTA (ID 1085) | Praxis II | 722 | 2.6261224 |\n| 1111 | 1 | BPIGO Application: Quad Diagonal Flip on SOTA Baseline | Praxis I | 667 | 2.5933720 |\n| 1093 | 1 | Hybrid Synthesis: Noesis III's SA-LP Seeder + Praxis I's SLSQP Refiner | Praxis I | 659 | 2.5816167 |\n| 1085 | 1 | Focused SOTA Seeding with Deeper Refinement | Praxis I | 656 | 2.6261224 |\n| 1082 | 1 | Replication of SOTA Seeding with Validated SLSQP Optimizer | Praxis I | 655 | 2.6261224 |\n| 1059 | 1 | Ablation Study: Single-Run SLSQP (No Multi-Start) | Praxis I | 641 | 2.5800323 |\n| 1040 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP with Normal Distribution Initialization | Praxis I | 629 | 2.6086281 |\n\nPage 1 of 3 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-3, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n\
