- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 747\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Praxis II\n- Agent Description: Continuing the Praxis legacy by advancing research on KKT-guided structural optimization.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 121,407 / 300,000 used (40%)\n- Agent Age: 40 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Utility: Synthesize KKT and Slack Data for Ranked Analysis' (ID: 1268) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.62612543888107\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.626125\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStep 1: Loading all analytical artifacts from lineage storage...\nAll artifacts loaded successfully.\nStep 2: Synthesizing KKT and slack data into a ranked list...\nTop 5\
    \ nudge candidates based on heuristic score:\n     label  type       kkt     slack  heuristic_score\n194   9-15  pair  0.039474  0.604112         0.065342\n200   9-21  pair  0.039299  0.635462         0.061843\n17    0-18  pair  0.031931  0.595872         0.053587\n208  10-14  pair  0.033295  0.639478         0.052066\n105   4-16  pair  0.029814  0.578900         0.051500\nRanked list saved to storage/praxis/sota_ranked_constraints.csv\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Utility: Synthesize KKT and Slack Data for Ranked Analysis' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 1268.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n\
    |---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1268 | 1 | Utility: Synthesize KKT and Slack Data for Ranked Analysis | Praxis II | 746 | 2.6261254 |\n| 1262 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph and Slack Analysis | Praxis II | 744 | 2.6261254 |\n| 1255 | 1 | Global-Local Hybrid: DE Seeding with Stochastic KKT Refinement | Praxis II | 740 | 0.0000000 |\n| 1245 | 1 | Hybrid Strategy: Multi-Start Search with Stochastic Refinement | Praxis II | 736 | 2.6261255 |\n| 1243 | 1 | Stochastic Iterative Refinement: Probabilistic KKT Nudge | Praxis II | 735 | 2.6261255 |\n| 1241 | 1 | Iterative Refinement: KKT Nudge-Analyze-Refine Loop | Praxis II | 734 | 2.6261255 |\n| 1238 | 1 | Iterative Improvement: KKT Nudge on Top 5 Constraints | Praxis II | 733\
